# Terraform / AWS

- Region: `ap-south-1`.
- Edit `infra/terraform/modules/*`; keep `stacks/{staging,prod}` thin.
- State + locks: `s3://terraform-locks-105927215604/MED0001/{env}/` with `use_lockfile = true`. Never commit `.terraform/`, `*.tfstate*`, `*.tflock`, `.terraform.lock.hcl`.
- Lambda: arm64, Java 21, SnapStart on published versions, alias `live`, optional provisioned concurrency. Never `$LATEST` in prod.
- Auth to AWS in CI: GitHub OIDC only — no long-lived access keys.
- Local: `make tf-fmt`, `make tf-validate`, optional `make tf-plan ENV=staging|prod`.
- Stuck lock: `/tf-unlock` / skill `terraform-force-unlock` — do not delete lock objects by hand unless instructed.
